s://www.facebook.com/HappinessAtWorkCertification\" mbr-if=\"facebook\">\n                        <span mbr-icon class=\"socicon-facebook socicon\"></span>\n                    </a>\n                    <a class=\"iconfont-wrapper bg-linkedin m-2\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/anphabe.com/\" target=\"_blank\" mbr-if=\"linkedin\">\n                        <span mbr-icon class=\"socicon-linkedin socicon\"></span>\n                    </a> \n                   \n                    <a class=\"iconfont-wrapper bg-youtube m-2\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/anphabevideo\" target=\"_blank\" mbr-if=\"youtube\">\n                        <span mbr-icon class=\"socicon-youtube socicon\"></span>\n                    </a>\n                    <a class=\"iconfont-wrapper bg-twitter m-2\" href=\"https://twitter.com/anphabe\" target=\"_blank\" mbr-if=\"twitter\">\n                        <span mbr-icon class=\"socicon-twitter socicon\"></span>\n                    </a>   \n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-3 text-content\">\n                <h5 mbr-text class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-2\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><b>\n                    Về giải thưởng HAW</b></h5>\n                <ul class=\"list mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".list\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                    <li class=\"mbr-text item-wrap\"><a href=\"index.html\" class=\"text-primary\">Giới thiệu</a></li>\n                    <li class=\"mbr-text item-wrap\"><span style=\"font-size: 0.9rem;\"><a href=\"phuong-phap.html\" class=\"text-primary\">Phương pháp &amp; Mô hinh</a></span></li>\n                    <li class=\"mbr-text item-wrap\"><span style=\"font-size: 0.9rem;\"><a href=\"lien-he.html\" class=\"text-primary\">Liên hệ</a></span></li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n            \n            <di